"Browse Web Page is for pages that only show their text once their scripts run. Each call opens the page in a new private browser that keeps nothing afterwards: no cookies, cache or storage come in or stay. Everything the page loads goes through a gate that lets only public addresses through, and images, video, fonts, popups and downloads are blocked. By default the page may load only from the address you approved, so some pages show little; the result tells the model how many requests to other sites were blocked. With “Let Browse Web Page load from other sites” on, the page's scripts may contact other websites, such as CDNs, and those sites see your IP address too. The card says which way it is. If the page moves to another address, Parley stops and a new card is needed. Stop, Lock and Quit close the page at once. It does not use the Mac's proxy settings, so behind a system proxy the site sees this Mac's own IP address." = "“浏览网页”用于只有在脚本运行后才显示文字的网页。每次调用都会在一个新的隐私浏览器中打开网页，结束后不保留任何东西：不会带入、也不会留下任何 Cookie、缓存或存储数据。网页加载的所有内容都要经过一道只放行公共地址的关卡，图片、视频、字体、弹出窗口和下载都会被阻止。默认情况下，网页只能从你批准的地址加载内容，因此有些网页显示的内容很少；结果会告诉模型有多少个对其他网站的请求被阻止。开启“允许‘浏览网页’从其他网站加载内容”后，网页的脚本可能会联系其他网站（例如 CDN），这些网站同样会看到你的 IP 地址。卡片会注明是哪种情况。如果网页跳转到另一个地址，Parley 会停止，需要新的卡片。“停止”“锁定”和“退出”会立即关闭网页。它不使用 Mac 的代理设置，因此在系统代理之后，网站看到的是这台 Mac 自己的 IP 地址。";
