"Opens one public web page in a private browser that runs its scripts, for pages Fetch Web Page reads as empty. It loads only from the site you approve, unless the switch below is on. It ignores the Mac's proxy settings. No images, no downloads, nothing kept afterwards. Asks every time and shows the host." = "在一个会运行网页脚本的私密浏览器中打开一个公开网页，用于“获取网页”读取为空的网页。除非打开了下方的开关，否则它只从你批准的网站加载内容。它会忽略 Mac 的代理设置。不加载图片，不下载，结束后不保留任何内容。每次都会询问，并显示主机。";
