"Parley" = "Parley";
"Parley can connect to MCP servers you add in Settings > MCP, by a local command or a remote URL, or by pasting a config from another MCP client. It offers their tools to the model, runs the calls the model makes, and sends the results back until the model answers." = "Parley 可以连接你在“设置”>“MCP”中添加的 MCP 服务器，添加方式可以是本地命令、远程 URL，或粘贴来自其他 MCP 客户端的配置。它会把这些服务器的工具提供给模型，执行模型发起的调用，并把结果发回，直到模型给出回答。";
"Parley does not follow redirects, so nothing was sent there. If that is the right address, put it in Settings as the base URL." = "Parley 不会跟随重定向，因此没有向该地址发送任何内容。如果那是正确的地址，请在设置中将其设为基础 URL。";
"Parley Help" = "Parley 帮助";
"Parley only contacts the API endpoints and MCP servers you configure, sign-in providers you approve and, if you turn on Fetch Web Page or Browse Web Page, each website you approve for one call (and, only if you allow it, the other public sites a browsed page's scripts load from). No telemetry, no analytics, no remote images. It looks for no servers on its own and reads no other app's MCP config." = "Parley 只会联系你配置的 API 端点和 MCP 服务器、你批准的登录提供商，以及（如果你开启了“获取网页”或“浏览网页”）你为单次调用批准的每个网站（并且仅在你允许时，还会联系被浏览网页的脚本从中加载内容的其他公共网站）。没有遥测，没有分析，没有远程图片。它不会自行查找服务器，也不会读取其他 App 的 MCP 配置。";
"Parley only contacts the API endpoints and MCP servers you configure, sign-in providers you approve and, if you turn on Fetch Web Page or Browse Web Page, each website you approve for one call (and, only if you allow it, the other public sites a browsed page's scripts load from). No telemetry." = "Parley 只会联系你配置的 API 端点和 MCP 服务器、你批准的登录提供商，以及（如果你开启了“获取网页”或“浏览网页”）你为单次调用批准的每个网站（并且仅在你允许时，还会联系被浏览网页的脚本从中加载内容的其他公共网站）。没有遥测。";
"Parley only contacts the API endpoints and MCP servers you configure, sign-in providers you approve and, if you turn on Fetch Web Page or Browse Web Page, each website you approve for one call. No telemetry; conversations stay in files on this Mac." = "Parley 只会联系你配置的 API 端点和 MCP 服务器、你批准的登录提供商，以及（如果你开启了“获取网页”或“浏览网页”）你为单次调用批准的每个网站。没有遥测；对话以文件形式保存在这台 Mac 上。";
"Parley supports local (stdio) and Streamable HTTP servers, tools only, with fixed headers or a sign-in in your browser. Resources, prompts, sampling, elicitation and the old HTTP+SSE transport are not supported." = "Parley 支持本地（stdio）和 Streamable HTTP 服务器，仅支持工具，可使用固定标头或在浏览器中登录。不支持资源（resources）、提示（prompts）、采样（sampling）、信息征询（elicitation）以及旧的 HTTP+SSE 传输方式。";
"Parley will contact this sign-in provider, then open it in your browser:" = "Parley 将联系此登录提供商，然后在你的浏览器中打开它：";
