"The address check and the connection are separate lookups, so a site that changes its DNS answer in between, or a proxy, can make the request reach a device on your network before Parley sees that and throws the answer away. The model never receives that answer. A proxy that answers every name with its own address, as Clash and Surge can, means the check cannot tell a device on your network from a public site. The card is the real defence: read the address before you allow it." = "地址检查和实际连接是两次独立的查询，因此如果网站在两次查询之间更改了 DNS 应答，或者存在代理，请求就可能在 Parley 察觉并丢弃该应答之前到达你网络中的设备。模型永远不会收到该应答。如果代理会用它自己的地址应答每个域名（Clash 和 Surge 就可能这样做），地址检查就无法区分你网络中的设备与公共网站。卡片才是真正的防线：允许之前请先看清地址。";
"The address contains hidden or right-to-left characters, shown here as \\u{…}." = "该地址包含隐藏字符或从右到左书写的字符，此处显示为 \\u{…}。";
"The API key could not be saved to the Keychain." = "无法将 API 密钥保存到钥匙串。";
"The arguments contain hidden characters, shown here as \\u{…}." = "参数包含隐藏字符，此处显示为 \\u{…}。";
"The base URL includes the version path; /chat/completions and /models are appended." = "基础 URL 包含版本路径；会在其后追加 /chat/completions 和 /models。";
"The callback port is a number from 1024 to 65535. Leave it blank to use a free one." = "回调端口是 1024 到 65535 之间的数字。留空则使用一个空闲端口。";
"The Cloudflare Tunnel is not connected to %@" = "Cloudflare Tunnel 未连接到%@";
"The command contains a space. It is run as one program name; put arguments under args." = "命令包含空格。它会被当作一个程序名运行；请将参数放在 args 下。";
"The command contains spaces. Put the program in Command and the rest under Arguments." = "命令包含空格。请把程序填在“命令”中，其余部分填在“参数”下。";
"The command, an argument or an environment value contains a variable such as ${VAR}. Parley keeps it literally and does not expand it: replace it in Settings > MCP after importing." = "命令、某个参数或某个环境变量值包含 ${VAR} 之类的变量。Parley 会按原样保留，不会展开它：请在导入后到“设置”>“MCP”中替换它。";
