"The connection dropped before the reply finished" = "回复完成前连接已断开";
"The connection through Cloudflare closed mid-reply: the server or the network went away." = "经由 Cloudflare 的连接在回复中途关闭：服务器或网络已断开。";
"the connection timed out" = "连接超时";
"The conversation (%@ tokens) plus Max tokens (%@) is more than the context (%@ tokens)." = "对话（%1$@ 个 token）加上最大 token 数（%2$@）超出了上下文（%3$@ 个 token）。";
