"The reply was cut off at the end of the context (or the server's own output limit). Start a new chat, fork from an earlier message or roll back to make room." = "回复在上下文末尾（或服务器自身的输出上限）处被截断。请开始新对话、从较早的消息分叉，或回退以腾出空间。";
