"This server needs you to sign in. Press Sign In in Settings > MCP, or add a static Authorization header if the server accepts one." = "此服务器需要你登录。请在“设置”>“MCP”中点按“登录”；如果服务器接受，也可以添加固定的 Authorization 标头。";
