"Tool calling" = "工具调用";
"Tool calling: ReAct (text), in the wrench popover, is for models and servers without tool support. Tools go to the model as text in the system prompt, and the model answers with Action and Action Input lines. It is off by default, and Parley never switches to it on its own; the popover offers Use ReAct when a server refuses or ignores tools. Every ReAct call asks first and can only be allowed once, even for a tool you always allow, because text can repeat what a tool wrote. Tool servers' descriptions then sit in the system prompt, marked as data. ReAct relies on the model following a format, so some models will not use tools well this way. If a model's template opens its thinking, a call it only drafted while thinking can bring up a card, and that thinking then goes back to the model." = "扳手弹出菜单中的“工具调用：ReAct（文本）”适用于不支持工具的模型和服务器。工具会以文本形式放在系统提示词中发给模型，模型用 Action 和 Action Input 行作答。此方式默认关闭，Parley 也从不自行切换到它；当服务器拒绝或忽略工具时，弹出菜单会提供“使用 ReAct”。每个 ReAct 调用都会先询问，并且只能允许一次，即使是你始终允许的工具也是如此，因为文本可能复述工具写下的内容。此时工具服务器的描述会放在系统提示词中，并标记为数据。ReAct 依赖模型遵循固定格式，因此有些模型用这种方式无法很好地使用工具。如果模型的模板会开启思考，模型仅在思考中拟写的调用也可能弹出卡片，而这段思考随后会被发回给模型。";
"Tool definitions take about %@ tokens of it. Turn off servers or tools you do not need with the wrench button (⇧⌘T)." = "其中工具定义约占 %@ 个 token。可用扳手按钮（⇧⌘T）关闭不需要的服务器或工具。";
"Tool definitions: about %@ tokens per request." = "工具定义：每次请求约 %@ 个 token。";
