"Tool names, descriptions, arguments and results go to the model's provider, and arguments to the MCP server. Toggling starts and stops nothing: a server starts when you send, and runs until you press Stop in Settings > MCP or quit." = "工具名称、描述、参数和结果会发送给模型的提供商，参数还会发送给 MCP 服务器。切换开关不会启动或停止任何东西：服务器在你发送消息时启动，并一直运行，直到你在“设置”>“MCP”中点按“停止”或退出 Parley。";
"Tool names, descriptions, arguments and results go to the model's provider." = "工具名称、描述、参数和结果会发送给模型的提供商。";
"Tool results stay in the conversation, encrypted when the conversation is. They are sent again with every message, like images. Regenerate does not undo what a tool did, and the model may run it again." = "工具结果会保留在对话中，对话加密时它们也会被加密。与图像一样，它们会随每条消息再次发送。重新生成不会撤销工具已经做过的事，而且模型可能会再次运行它。";
