"Turn servers on for a conversation with the wrench button next to the paperclip (⇧⌘T). Nothing starts until you send a message in a conversation that uses the server, or press Connect in Settings. Turning a server off for a chat does not stop it: it runs until you press Stop in Settings or quit." = "用回形针旁边的扳手按钮（⇧⌘T）为对话开启服务器。在使用该服务器的对话中发送消息，或在“设置”中点按“连接”之前，不会启动任何服务器。为某个对话关闭服务器并不会停止它：它会一直运行，直到你在“设置”中点按“停止”或退出 Parley。";
