"What a tool returns goes to the model's provider, like any tool result. A page or a file can tell the model to read something and put it in an address. That is why these tools have no Always Allow: check the arguments on each card, the address above all." = "与任何工具结果一样，工具返回的内容会发送给模型的提供商。网页或文件可能会指使模型读取某些内容并把它放进一个地址中。这就是这些工具没有“始终允许”的原因：请检查每张卡片上的参数，尤其是地址。";
"Where files live" = "文件存放位置";
"With its images this conversation is about %@ per request, more than the %@ %@ accepts: every message sends the images again. Remove some, or fork from a message before the first image." = "加上图像，此对话每次请求约 %1$@，超过了 %3$@ 接受的 %2$@：每条消息都会再次发送这些图像。请移除部分图像，或从第一张图像之前的消息分叉。";
"With its tool results this conversation is about %@ per request, more than the %@ %@ accepts: every message sends them again. Fork from an earlier message, or roll back." = "加上工具结果，此对话每次请求约 %1$@，超过了 %3$@ 接受的 %2$@：每条消息都会再次发送这些结果。请从较早的消息分叉，或回退。";
